{"script":"s_0_4_1","des":"与密林深处的沃夫加聊聊。","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara012_1","mirrow":false,"x":277.5,"trans":true,"y":-419,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara012_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":277.5,"trans":true,"y":-419,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"猎人沃夫加","text":"[show]了不起……你们的实力果然如我所料一样强大。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"猎人沃夫加","text":"[show]这是给你们的报酬，感谢你们出手相助。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"猎人沃夫加","text":"[show]不过狩猎的道路还是很长的，你们还有继续进步的空间。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"猎人沃夫加","text":"[show]要记住，猎物与猎人的身份转换只在一瞬之间，切记不要被自己的猎物反客为主了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"猎人沃夫加","text":"[show]这是我这个老猎人可以给你们的忠告了，不过我相信你们的实力。[r]哪怕真有一天遇见了强大的猎物，你们也一定能成功将它狩猎。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"猎人沃夫加","text":"[show]好了，我大概还会在这里呆一段时间的……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"猎人沃夫加","text":"[show]当然，我不会干扰这里的生态和你们的营地，这点请你们放心。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara